### 查询全部学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### 根据 id 查询学生
GET http://localhost:8080/students/1

### 添加学生
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "10",
  "name": "测试学生",
  "age": 20,
  "score": 88
}

### 修改学生
PUT http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "10",
  "name": "测试学生修改版",
  "age": 21,
  "score": 90
}

### 删除学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/10

### 条件查询
GET http://localhost:8080/students/condition?name=张&minScore=60&maxScore=100

### 分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page?page=1&pageSize=3

### 条件分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page/condition?page=1&pageSize=3&name=张&minScore=60&maxScore=100
###
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "",
  "name": "",
  "age": -1,
  "score": 999
}
###
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
"name": "",
"age": 0,
"score": 120
}
###
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page/query?pageNum=0&pageSize=200

### 条件分页：minScore 大于 maxScore 错误测试
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page/query?minScore=90&maxScore=60&pageNum=1&pageSize=10

### 删除不存在的学生
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/999

### 批量删除
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/batch?ids=2&ids=3
###
GET http://localhost:8080/students/page/query?pageNum=1&pageSize=5
###
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "100",
  "name": "Lombok测试",
  "age": 20,
  "score": 88
}